### Page 1 of 12

```text
MEMORANDUM
TO:

Mayor Patrick Collins, and City Council
FROM:

TJ Barttelbort, Purchasing Manager
DATE:

May 18, 2022
SUBJECT:
Professional Services Agreement between the City of Cheyenne and Steiner
Thuesen PLLC for the Cemetery Irrigation System Design project
______________________________________________
Two (2) Responsive Proposals were submitted under Request for Proposal (RFP) #10-22, for the
Cemetery Irrigation System Design project.

The proposals were received from:
1. Steiner Thuesen PLLC, Billings, MT.
2. Aqua Engineering Inc., Fort Collins, CO.

Upon review of the two (2) proposals by the evaluation panel, the group has recommended
acceptance of the proposal submitted by Steiner Thuesen PLLC (Billings, Montana), for a project
award amount of $144,692.00 (Design Process & Construction Period Services).

Basis for award was based on a Qualifications based review and scoring of proposals.  Steiner
Thuesen PLLC, submitted the highest scoring proposal, therefore their sealed pricing envelope
was opened & negotiated.

Funding:
032-17-1751-45-43108 (2021 Ballot | Special Purpose Option Tax)

Project # 220050

Grand Total: $144,692.00
```

