```text
City of Cheyenne RFP #10-22 / Professional Services Agreement (PSA)
Cemetery Irrigation System Design
Page 1 of 8

City Contract No. ____________

PROFESSIONAL SERVICES AGREEMENT
FOR
CEMETERY IRRIGATION SYSTEM DESIGN

This Professional Services Agreement (“Agreement”) is made and entered into by and between
the City of Cheyenne, located at 2101 O’Neil Avenue, Cheyenne, Wyoming 82001 (“City”),
and Steiner Thuesen PLLC, located at 1925 Grand Avenue, Suite 105, Billings, Montana
59102 (“Consultant”).  This Agreement shall become effective upon the date of the last signature
affixed hereto.

RECITALS

In consideration of the mutual covenants and obligations herein expressed, it is agreed by and
between the parties as follows:

1.
SCOPE OF WORK
The Consultant agrees to provide services for Cemetery Irrigation System Design
project, in accordance with City of Cheyenne Request for Proposal (RFP) #10-22,
incorporated herein by reference, the Consultant’s submitted proposal, incorporated
herein by reference, and Exhibit B – Scope Modification, incorporated herein by
reference.

2.
TIME OF PERFORMANCE
The work included in this Scope of Work will be completed by the following: Phase 1
Design Process Completion, September 25, 2022.  Phase 2 - Construction Period
Services Completion, December 31, 2023.

3.
COMPENSATION
In consideration of the services to be performed pursuant to this Agreement, the
Consultant will bill the City and the City agrees to pay Consultant a not to exceed amount
of One Hundred Forty-Four Thousand, Six Hundred Ninety-Two Dollars
($144,692.00) as stated in Exhibit A – Fee Proposal.

4.
CONSULTANT RESPONSIBILITY
In providing services under this Agreement, the Consultant shall perform in a manner
consistent with that degree of care and skill ordinarily exercised by members of the same
profession currently practicing under similar circumstances. Upon notice to the
Consultant, the Consultant will, without additional compensation, correct those services
not meeting such a standard.

By Stefanie Boster at 12:31 pm, May 17, 2022
```

