Dear Mr. Barttelbort:

We are pleased to respond to your request for proposals for the City of Cheyenne Cemetery
Irrigation System Design.   Our price proposal is attached to this letter.   We propose that both
PHASE 1 - DESIGN PROCESS and PHASE 2 – CONSTRUCTION PERIOD SERVICES portions
of the project be conducted on a lump sum basis.  Copies of our current rate schedules are
included for your information.

The accompanying price structure is proposed for the services outlined in Section F.
Modifications To Scope of Work of our technical proposal.  Our price proposal will be honored
for a period of 120 calendar days following the date of this proposal. After that period, we
reserve the right to renegotiate prices.  We propose providing full construction period services.
If there are tasks listed under Phase 2 that you feel aren’t necessary, we can adjust our proposed
Scope of Work and price proposal accordingly.

All contractual responsibility shall rest solely on STEINER THUESEN PLLC as the prime
consultant.   STEINER THUESEN PLLC is responsible for execution of the contract on behalf of
