### Page 12 of 12

```text
F.
MODIFICATIONS TO SCOPE OF WORK

The following adjustments have been made to the original Scope of Work.

PHASE 2 – CONSTRUCTION PERIOD SERVICES:

1. Bidding Period Services
a. Our office will coordinate distribution of the plans and project manual, and
maintain the planholders list.  City to provide this service.
b. We will respond to contractor questions during the Bidding phase (SOW #8).
Contractor questions pertaining to technical irrigation design and system
component issues will be reviewed and addenda will be drafted and
distributed by our office as necessary.
c. We will conduct one pre-bid conference on the site (SOW #8). These meetings are
held to inform all bidders of the job conditions and requirements.  They are an
effective way to assure comparable and responsible bids for construction.
d. Your office will handle the bid opening.  We will participate via teleconference.
e. Assist with bid analysis and contractor selection (SOW #8). Following the bid
opening we will tabulate and check the bids, consider possible alternative bid
items, and issue a letter of award recommendation to you for action.
f. Following your approval of the bids, a Notice of Award will be issued to the
successful Contractor.  Notice of Award to be provided by City.
g. We will finalize the Contract for Construction and complete all necessary
documentation to permit construction activities to begin.   City to review all
contract paperwork, insurance certificates, bonds, etc. and finalize the contract
for construction.

11.
